WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.690
Mutsuki, someday, I swear...

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.010
It's a promise!

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:52.450
Chance Encounters

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.150
My eyes! Wh-what is that?

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.420
Hamaji, what are you doing?

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.690
Brewing a tea that will 
protect you from the cold.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.390
Oh, tea... That's tea, is it?

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.520
With this, everyone will be impervious 
to this year's common cold.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:12.870
Hamaji, you're rather knowledgeable 
about herbs and the such.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.260
Where did you learn about them?

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.220
Supposedly I was born into a 
family that worked in this field.

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:21.590
Perhaps it's in my blood. 
These things intrigue me.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:25.260
Yeah? Do you still remember your family?

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.540
I've forgotten all about them.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.860
Oh, no!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.860
It's about time I returned to my dorm.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.310
You'll escort me back, won't you?

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:38.550
But of course!

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.280
This should be the right road, but...

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.070
Excuse me, Miss!

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.810
I'm searching for an inn 
called the Kona-ya.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.140
Have you heard of it?

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.690
Yes! Would you like me 
to show you the way?

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.690
I'd appreciate it! Please do!

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.790
I just arrived in the Imperial Capital

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:03.490
and a beautiful lady is 
showing me to my inn!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.390
I am unworthy of such an honor.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:06.650
You're too much!

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.590
You'll find it straight down this road.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.680
Thank you!

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.710
Are you traveling by yourself?

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.560
Yeah, I guess...

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.840
Would you happen to be free tonight?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.210
I know of a wonderful restaurant.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.480
Are you all right?

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.600
Naturally, I had every intention 
of turning her down, Snow Princess.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.870
INN KONA-YA

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:54.720
I said that I'm not gonna get 
into a snowball fight with you!

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:55.500
I'm leaving.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.480
Y-you jerk!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.260
Damn it!

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:03.860
Whoa!

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.200
Aren't you...?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.420
Dosetsu!

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.740
What's up? Decide to visit 
the Imperial Capital?

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:18.770
Yeah! What a coincidence, running 
into you here of all places!

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.780
Snow Princess, long time no see!

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:28.910
I see. So you've come in search 
of your younger sister?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.550
Right. Our parents passed away 
without warning over ten years ago.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:36.990
My sister was adopted out and I 
haven't heard from her since...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.670
I can imagine how you must feel.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.510
You'll have a hard time searching 
this vast city on your own.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.550
If you like, we'd be willing to help.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.360
I'd appreciate that!

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.820
So, got anything to go off of?

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.530
Her name is Mutsuki and she's 15.

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.410
She was born in Nerima Village.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:54.910
Both of her foster parents 
have passed away.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.650
I have no idea where she 
went after she lost them.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:01.610
In that case, we'd have 
better luck if we searched

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.440
the red-light district instead 
of the institutions and schools.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.200
Th-the red-light district?!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:08.670
There aren't that many 
places for children without

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:09.950
guardians to turn to...

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.600
You have a point.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:14.620
B-but I can't believe 
that's where she went!

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.700
Of course, we'll check the 
institutions and schools as well.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:19.190
Do you have a photograph of her?

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:24.100
I'm afraid not, but her hair 
should be an unusual color.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.230
Maybe it's because we were 
a family of physicians,

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:28.360
but it was customary for 
us to begin developing

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:30.730
an immunity to various drugs 
starting at an early age.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.360
This is the result.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.280
Red hair, huh?

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.860
All right. We'll help you look.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:37.910
Thank you very much!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:39.730
You have a guest?

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:47.740
This is Asakeno, a highly 
skilled musician.

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:51.490
This is the young master of a famous 
pharmacy in the Western Capital.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.500
I hope you call upon me for my services.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.870
Asakeno... It-it's a pleasure!

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:01.870
She's so beautiful that I 
couldn't help but get excited!

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.880
What if Snow Princess 
gets jealous again...?!

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.590
Snow Princess is smiling!

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.890
Like Points are super good!

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:13.780
At long last, spring has come!

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.240
It's easy to see what he is thinking.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:20.770
He's in for a major shock 
when he learns the truth...

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:29.780
Kaho, Shino won't be coming 
until he finishes his errands.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.420
Why don't you wait where 
it is nice and warm?

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:35.790
Nah. I wanna wait here.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:42.790
Jeez, Yana! Aren't you ready yet?

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:46.050
I'm sorry! I didn't 
mean to make you wait.

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:49.750
Aw, you buttoned it up wrong again!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.230
Really! I heard you were a 
princess, but good grief!

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:55.240
I'm not accustomed to 
Western-style clothing...

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.650
You're all set!

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.280
Thank you kindly.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.310
I am really excited 
about seeing the town!

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.370
Let's shop till we drop!

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:10.120
So why am I in charge of searchin' 
the red-light district?!

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:13.130
What are you so afraid of?

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.460
I'm going to leave you 
behind, Young Master.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:26.580
A redhead around 15 or 16?

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.720
I wouldn't recognize her 
if she dyed her hair.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.480
And names don't mean squat 
in a place like this.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:36.470
That right? Well, thanks, man.

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:43.850
Master of Wind, don't 
be such a stranger.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.630
All you needed was but to ask

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.360
and I would have offered my assistance.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:52.970
Hey, Gramps. I'm sorry, but...

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:56.490
What's this? I see you are 
the princess' adopted son.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:08:00.550
What marvelous luck to stumble upon 
such distinguished individuals.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.550
Who are you?

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:05.140
My name is Asen.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:06.970
I am a kindred spirit, Master.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.000
Asen?

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.540
Goodness!

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:12.410
You were certainly quick to say my name.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:15.670
A redheaded damsel around 
the age of 15 or 16...

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:19.010
Very well. I shall find her for you.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:21.660
Huh? I don't recall asking you to-

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.520
Crap! Kobungo, take it back!

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:25.400
If you'll pardon me.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:33.620
Moron!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:34.510
Ow!

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.910
Why did you blurt out his name?!

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.260
That was a demon!

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:41.410
You might have sworn a pact with him!

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.420
A redheaded damsel!

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:04.310
No...

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:06.370
This isn't it...

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:07.560
Red hair...

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:15.710
This isn't it either!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.450
Where can I find real red hair?!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:26.180
Hamaji, are you gonna keep shopping?

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:27.460
You bet!

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:34.210
May I run by the dorm 
and drop these off?

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:37.590
Sure thing, but be sure 
to come right back.

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:40.730
Shino, I'm getting hungry!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.600
Wait till I'm done!

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:46.160
Will Shino be all right?

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.020
He can handle that!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.110
He is a boy, after all.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:00.670
Kaho?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.880
The smell of blood...?

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:20.260
Hmm? This one turned 
out to be mighty small.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.460
How old are you?

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:22.860
Seven.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.390
Goodness! I've gone after 
the wrong girl again.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:28.610
And here the Master of Wind is waiting!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.510
But such is the way of things...

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.820
Hey, are you hurt?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.650
You smell like blood, Mister.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:41.550
Child, your eyes cannot see, can they?

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:44.830
That would explain why I 
thought you were so placid.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.660
My name isn't "Child".

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.320
I'm Kaho.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.550
Who are you?

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:54.800
Shino!

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.410
Sosuke, sorry!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.770
They still aren't done shopping.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.270
Have you seen Kaho?

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.550
Kaho? No...

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:05.030
She vanished when I wasn't looking.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:07.200
And then I could smell blood.

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.560
Blood?!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.990
Murasame, look for Kaho!

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:12.450
Roger!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.280
I am Asen.

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:19.310
Asen? What does that mean?

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.970
The "False Sage".

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.710
But I must say, the one who

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:26.830
gave you this name was 
terribly powerful.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:31.460
I got the name Kaho a long 
time ago when I was abandoned.

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.720
You are mistaken.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:36.010
A name only becomes a "true name" 
once it has been given meaning.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:37.890
There must be someone.

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.850
Someone has given meaning to your name.

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:41.470
Kaho!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.470
I found Kaho!

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.360
Found ya!

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.470
Kaho, are you okay?

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.350
Mr. Shino?

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:51.980
Kaho!

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:55.480
You bastard! What did you do to Kaho?!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.480
I didn't do a thing.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.490
Must you get so riled up

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.430
over something as simple as 
confusing her for another?

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:06.710
Kaho!

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.000
Kaho, are you all right?

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:14.740
Thank goodness...

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.150
Wow, isn't that a cute hairpin?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:20.390
This...

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.530
...looks just like one 
I had a long time ago.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.070
This one is cute, too!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:30.150
I really liked it, but I must have 
lost it somewhere along the line...

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.020
That's not true.

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:38.020
I didn't lose it. I...

00:12:58.180 --> 00:12:59.210
Yana?

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:09.930
Neither this nor this is red hair...

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:13.130
I will find red hair.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.200
How many does this make it?

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.840
No more, please...!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.820
All of the victims are 
young women with red hair.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.170
There are too many for that 
to be a mere coincidence.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:33.660
Captain!

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:35.770
The lad from Kona-ya 
needs a word with you.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:40.390
These murders... They might be my fault.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:41.550
What?!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:45.100
A strange man overheard 
this idiot and decided

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.500
to start looking for 
a woman with red hair.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:48.970
A strange man?

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:51.050
He was an old goblin.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.570
He called himself Asen.

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:57.660
If I turned into Fuki, I 
could track him by smell...

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.870
You'd stand out at this time of day.

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.630
Wait until after sunset.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.210
B-Bro!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:04.190
You got that?

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.470
This was another dud...

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.550
Red hair!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.640
The wind?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.350
No, that was...

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.120
Dearie me. What was I thinking?

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.000
That was clearly a man, wasn't it?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.780
And one accompanied by a princess!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.280
That was dangerous, 
most dangerous indeed.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:01.540
That red hair is most assuredly real!

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:14.760
Sorry! The princess is 
in a horribly foul mood.

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:18.770
You'd better be prepared to lose an arm.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:26.030
MY ARM!

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:34.380
He was laden with the smell of blood.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.340
Maybe I should have outright 
killed him instead...

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:51.270
Mutsuki?

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:52.800
Hamaji!

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.480
I'm sorry.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:56.740
I found her back that way.

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.630
My name is Hamaji.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.060
Thank you for saving me.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.560
Hamaji? Are you friends with Shino?

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.270
This is my little sister.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:12.890
Little sister?!

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:15.070
You don't resemble each 
other in the least.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.470
We aren't related by blood.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.230
I was simply welcomed 
into Otsuka Village

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:24.080
a little over ten years ago.

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:27.840
Do you remember anything before then?

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.340
Did you come from a 
family of physicians?

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:34.840
I can't say. I don't remember...

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.520
Could the sister Dosetsu 
is looking for be...?

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:41.100
I have a curfew, so I need to go.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:48.700
Hamaji?

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.730
Hey, Dosetsu! Isn't she your...?

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.690
She's my sister, Mutsuki.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:56.430
I recognized her in an instant.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.620
Why aren't you going after her?!

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:00.530
That isn't necessary.

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.680
I'm just happy to know that she's alive.

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:07.260
It looked like she didn't remember me...

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.500
Besides, I've already died once.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.180
I'm no longer human.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:14.630
She doesn't need someone like me.

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:17.640
What do you mean by that?

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.530
If she knew someone like me was her 
brother, it'd only trouble her.

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:23.390
I'd feel bad for her.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:28.860
So what?!

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.650
You got a problem with being alive?!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.060
Would you rather be dead 
and miss seeing her for

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:34.620
the first time since 
you were separated?!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.130
Chew on that!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:57.120
Back then, I told myself 
that I wanted to live

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.680
I could see my sister again.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:05.810
And you made my wish come true...

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.660
...in exchange for your beautiful voice.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:20.570
FRAGRANCE OF MANY DELIGHTS

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.260
Hamaji!

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:34.590
Sorry for stopping you.

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:37.590
There was something that 
I just had to give you.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:38.750
Here!

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:46.450
Back when we were kids, 
you really treasured this.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.170
I'll be in the Imperial 
Capital for a while.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:54.160
I'm getting ready to open up shop here.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.740
If this is where you live,

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.630
then I wouldn't mind living here.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:10.050
You must be happy, Hamaji.

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:17.280
I didn't believe him at all...

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.370
when he made that promise.

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:23.820
I thought I had been abandoned, 
so I cast aside my name.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:27.490
I did my best not to remember him.

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:31.640
But Dosetsu has been searching 
for you this whole time.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:40.430
Shino, if I went missing, 
would you look for me?

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.650
I would! To the ends of the Earth.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:50.240
In fact, the entire reason 
I wound up coming to the

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:52.420
Imperial Capital was 
to find you, remember?

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:54.470
That's right.

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:01.590
Mutsuki, someday, I swear...

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:05.150
...I will come for you.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.230
It's a promise!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.270
My arm...!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:26.020
Master of Wind!

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:31.580
Damn it! Your "help" was unwanted!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.590
KONA-YA

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:44.690
What is wrong with your brother?

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:47.300
He ate something that 
didn't sit right with him.

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.310
Don't worry. He's reaping what he sowed.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.600
Shut up!

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:56.170
Starting with Inukai, I wish to 
thank everyone for your help.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.610
I don't know how to 
express my gratitude.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.860
I'm glad you found your sister.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.970
But I'm amazed that your sister

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.850
is also an old friend 
of Shino's and Sosuke's.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.590
Talk about coincidence, huh?

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:09.870
Coincidence!

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.390
Speaking of coincidences, 
Inukai's birthmark...

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:17.250
...is the exact same as the 
one on my left shoulder.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.890
Oh, about that. Actually, 
I have one as well.

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:22.020
What?!

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:26.010
So, uh, would you happen to 
have a somewhat mysterious gem?

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:28.950
How'd you know?

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.020
Were these the in thing a long time ago?

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:36.020
Uh, guys? What's the matter?

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.490
Coincidence...

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:43.180
D-Dosetsu, you're supposed to tell me 
things like that right off the bat!

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:45.470
Huh? "Right off the bat"? Tell you what?

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:46.150
You'll collect all of them eventually...

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:46.380
Coincidence! Coincidence!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.920
...even if you don't hunt each 
and every one down, Shino.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:48.560
I swear, you just have to be a 
pain in the butt about everything!

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.640
Wait, I didn't know this was 
what you were looking for...

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:51.810
Well, it's not as though he has worked 
hard to collect the gems thus far.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.660
So why the heck didn't you 
tell me about that sooner?!

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.020
He's such a moron.

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:55.140
You could say he leads 
a "blissful life".

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.000
How was I supposed to know...?

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:41.020
Spirited Away

00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:28.720
You must be relieved to 
have found your sister.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.980
Yeah! But she's hiding how 
she feels by being mean.

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:33.090
First she ignored me and

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.680
then she made me taste test 
her medicine for poison...

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.430
But she's just so darn cute!

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:39.020
I'm gonna go check on her!

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:41.020
I wonder how Hinaginu is doing...
